Does this work? I just kicked a trapped box in wizmode and
it triggered the trap. And zapping a wand of opening at a
trapped locked box won't get you past the trap, so I don't
see how a key would help (in fact I'm sure that I've
triggered a trap when using a key before).

By the way, if my calculations are correct, here are the
chances that a container is trapped after you've #untrapped
n times and not found anything, assuming a minimum 1/3
success rate (at xlevel 1):
0: 10%
1: 6.9%
2: 4.7%
3: 3.2%
4: 2.1%
...and multiply by something a little more than 2/3 for every
n>4.
If you're at character level 14, which should yield a 58.8%
chance of finding the trap:
0: 10%
1: 4.4%
2: 1.9%
3: 0.8%
...so doing #untrap twice on each chest seems like a good idea,
but more than five on the castle chest is probably overdoing it,
unless you've done a really good low-level dive.


